Drop screenshots here. The README references the following filenames —
just save your screenshots with these exact names and they'll appear:

  - hero.png                 (banner / overview shot of the live page)
  - live-stream.png          (full /live page in action)
  - preprocessing-scope.png  (the new 5-stage preprocessing panel)
  - architecture-diagram.png (Mermaid flow diagram from /architecture)
  - architecture-math.png    (math panel expanded under the diagram)
  - training-dashboard.png   (/train page with loss/accuracy charts)
  - probability-strip.png    (the rolling probability strip from /live)
  - topomap.png              (band-power topomap on /live)
  - research-page.png        (/research dataset list)

PNG / JPG / WebP all work. Aspect ratio 16:9 reads best for full-width.
